    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1498">

                <pb facs="1298" n="1040" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg1040"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">to the Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-09T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 9, 1915, 5 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2088. Your 2736, September 3. Is Department to understand that British Government
                    has agreed to and officially sanctioned the use of these German ships interned
                    in the United States and other neutral ports?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
